# Frontend (`apps/web`)

- Server Components by default; Client Components only for interaction/3D/browser APIs.
- Domain features in `features/<domain>/` — avoid dumping everything in `components/`.
- Apollo for GraphQL; never invent mock REST for catalog/cart/orders.
- Dynamic-import 3D (`@react-three/fiber`) — never load GLBs on pages that do not need them.
- Cart/wishlist UI may use Zustand for UX; **prices and stock always from API**.
- Checkout: no heavy 3D; keep the flow fast and simple.
- Admin UI must look different from the storefront (ops dashboard, not shop theme).

Forms: React Hook Form + Zod. Charts (admin): Recharts.

Reuse UI: search `components/` before adding new markup. Shared pieces live in `components/ui|shared|layout|navigation|3d`; promote feature components when used twice. See `docs/components.md`.
